    {
      "id": "claim_0c6db8be7ae44f4ead1135e41c38abac",
      "statement": "On deduction success, deduce appends a synthetic derive event with rule == 'TARGET-REACHED' whose inputs are the givens in the target's parent set; build_views special-cases it by preferring non-TARGET-REACHED producers and falling back to it only when no real derivation event matches the target.",
