    {
      "id": "claim_08876e6c6a3c44eda3a34340cb2afe54",
      "statement": "Deadend events fire for three reasons in deduction: 'max depth exceeded', an unresolvable input 'needed for rule ...', and rule exhaustion 'no rule or known fact'; they carry fact_kind rather than fact_id because a dead end is an unresolvable kind.",
