    {
      "id": "claim_4285e7cc71cd4b0dab0307892989e3e7",
      "statement": "Join events mark dedup-collapse: in deduction, when several known facts of a kind exist, ev_join(kind, [ids...]) is recorded before memoizing the first candidate; in induction, when a rule fires but add_fact finds the output already known, ev_join is recorded instead of a duplicate derive.",
