    {
      "id": "claim_a58bfcea63d94a7c8f76aab9935ff4e9",
      "statement": "Unknown events are terminal: deduce appends ev_unknown('no rule could derive the target from available givens', evidence hint 'add a missing given or rule') when no rule can derive the target and returns an UNKNOWN result; induce closes with ev_unknown('no rule produced the target').",
