    {
      "id": "claim_0c096bf36d7b4c33bc7785765a67acf9",
      "statement": "verify_physics is the one shipped path that builds views without build_views: when no target kind can be identified in the problem text it returns a synthetic UNKNOWN VerificationResult whose success_path is a hand-written list of a single unknown event ('no target kind identified in problem', evidence 'phrase your target as find the <quantity>') and whose failure_trail and full are empty.",
