    {
      "id": "claim_62f5285d72104c70b2ea1105dface2b5",
      "statement": "View selection is a render-time decision, not a pipeline-time one: the engine always computes all three views; the CLI restricts --view to success-path|failure-trail|full and applies it only at print time, JSON mode emits status/answer/target plus per-view event counts, and the verify_physics view kwarg is accepted but never consulted.",
