    {
      "id": "claim_ec09c7255afd48e8a10df4f2b63ed4b8",
      "statement": "Grammar-level rejections are auditable through the trace views: the physics rule precondition returns a non-empty reason string for arity or dimension mismatch, the engine records any non-None reason as an ev_reject event, so dimensionally wrong firings appear in the failure-trail and full views.",
